script variable replies = []
script variable errors = []
on optional
 ask a to read
 put it after replies
 ask b to read nothing
 put it after replies
 tell a to note
 say replies
 return it
end optional
on read value
 try
  ask a to read value
  put it after replies
 catch e
  put e after errors
 end try
end read
function unused
 tell b to note "retained"
end unused
on caught
 try
  throw "caught"
 catch e
 end try
 ask b to read
 tell b to note
end caught
